    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ku'v'ezya vizwalo vya ki'hozya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku' ku'tu'mi'la wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, v'afuumaga visoga vizwalo vya ku'zwala itungo lya ku'v'ezya muli'mo gwa Hantu' Hasondo. V'amusumi'laga Aloni vizwalo visondo ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'av'ezyaga ki'zibao ku' wu'zi wa zahabu na wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, haki'mo na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'ayi'sulaga zahabu ku' nnundo na ku'yi'v'ezya nnieniengazu, na v'ayi'putaga yi'v'e wu'zi ki'gele v'awu'fuume ku' wu'tonto haki'mo na wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, na katani nsoga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'zibao cheni'cho v'aki'v'ezezyaga mikwato iv'i'li' zya ku'tungi'la mu mav'ega ki'la iv'ega mukwato gu'mo, u'go gu'sumi'lilwe ku' nsoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwato gwa ki'zibao gwa wu'lembwe gwa ku'tunga mu muki'mbi'li', gwav'eziv'agwa ku' vilwani'lo vyene vivyo, ku' wu'zi wa zahabu, na wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, haki'mo na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe, gwasumi'li'lagwa ku'v'a ki'ntu' ki'mo na ki'zibao cheni'cho. V'av'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'apu'nzaga mawe av'i'li' ga mupango ga shohamu, na ku'gatu'u'la mu vyokazyo vya zahabu vya wu'lembwe, ago gatonilwe mina ga v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Izilaeli, ki'ti' musuli i'vyo ali'gu'tonaga muhuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mawe genago ago gali' mu vyokazyo v'agatungaga ha igu'lya na mikwato zya mu mav'ega ga i'cho ki'zibao ki'gele gav'e mwizu' ku' V'aizilaeli, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'av'ezyaga kamufuko ka ha ki'kuv'a ku' wu'tonto ki'ti' i'cho ki'zibao, ku' wu'zi wa zahabu, na wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamufuko kenako kav'age ka mugelani'lo ako ndi' kagondilwe, wu'lihu na wu'gali'nhu wako sentimita maku'mi av'i'li' na iv'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamufuko kenako kalembagwa ku' mihelo ine zya mawe ga mupango. Muhelo gwa kwandya gwav'age na mawe ga akiki, topazi na bahalamani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhelo gwa wu'v'i'li' gwav'age na mawe ga zumalidi, yakuti na alimasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhelo gwa wu'datu' gwav'age na mawe ga yasinto, ageti na ametisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhelo gwa wu'ne gwav'age na mawe ga kilisolito, shohamu na yasipi. Gose gatu'u'lagwa mu vyokazyo vya zahabu vya wu'lembwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene kwav'age na mawe iku'mi na av'i'li' ago gatonilwe mina iku'mi na av'i'li' ga v'ana v'amwa Izilaeli. Ki'la li'mo ndi' li'tonilwe ki'ti' muhuli, na ku'v'a na lina li'mo mugati' na mina ga magongo ago iku'mi na av'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'av'ezyaga mikufu zya zahabu nsoso i'zyo zipelegilwe ki'ti' lu'goye, ku'nguno ya kamufuko ka ha ki'kuv'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vyene vivyo v'av'ezyaga vyokazyo viv'i'li' vya zahabu vya wu'lembwe na pete iv'i'li' zya zahabu, na ku'zitungi'la ku' mapembo av'i'li' ga ku' igu'lya na kamufuko kenako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'azitungaga nsoto iv'i'li' zya mikufu ku' pete zyeni'zyo i'zyo zili' ku' mapembo ga kamufuko kenako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' na i'zyo nsoto zingi' zya mikufu v'azitungaga ku' i'vyo vyokazyo viv'i'li' vya mawe. Vyene vivyo v'azitungani'zyaga ku' mikwato zya mu mav'ega ga i'cho ki'zibao, ku' lwandi' lwa ku' mbele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'av'ezyaga pete iv'i'li' zya zahabu, na ku'zitu'u'la mu mapembo av'i'li' ga ha nsi'li'li' na kamufuko ku' nnuma yako bi'hi' na ki'zibao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'av'ezyaga pete zingi' iv'i'li' zya zahabu, na ku'zidimani'zya ha lwandi' lwa ha nsi'li'li' ya mikwato zya mav'ega, ha lwandi' lwa ku' mbele lwa cheni'cho ki'zibao, bi'hi' na ipi'ndo ha igu'lya hadoo na mukwato gwa mu muki'mbi'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pete zya kamufuko kenako zyatungani'ziv'agwa na pete zya ki'zibao ku' lu'goye lwa langi ya bululu, ki'gele kaleke ku'soka na kikali'le mukwato gwa wu'lembwe gwa mu muki'mbi'li', ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' v'afuumaga ijoho lya ku'zwali'la ki'zibao ku' ki'tambala cha langi ya bululu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' v'adu'laga idu'lu'lu' lya ku'v'i'ti'zya mutwe. Ha lwandi' lwa nhingo v'ahapilimyaga ki'tambala i'cho ki'fuumilwe ki'gele ku'du' li'tandu'ke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku' wu'pi'nde walyo wa ha nsi'li'li' ku'pilima lwandi' lose yalembagwa ku' masu'mbano ga makomamanga ga langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' v'av'ezyaga miyi'mba zya zahabu nsoso, na ku'zidimani'zya ku'pilimya ku' wu'pi'nde wenu'wo. Hagati' ya ki'la ikomamanga v'atu'u'laga muyi'mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zyeni'zyo miyi'mba na makomamanga vihelaga ku'li'pilima ipi'ndo lya ijoho lyeni'lo: ikomamanga, muyi'mba, ikomamanga, muyi'mba, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' v'av'afuumi'laga nhanzo ku' katani nsoga Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na isimangi'la na nkofila zya katani nsoga, vizwalo vya mugati' vya katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na mukwato gwa mu muki'mbi'li' gwapu'ndagwa visoga ku' katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe na wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa. V'av'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' v'av'ezyaga ndezi nsondo ku' zahabu nsoso, na ku'yi'tona ha igu'lya yayo, ki'ti' i'vyo gu'li'tonagwa muhuli, “MUSONDO KU'MWA GU'KU' MULUNGU.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndezi yeni'yo v'ayi'tungaga ha igu'lya na isimangi'la ku' lu'goye lwa langi ya bululu, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ku'gelani'la kwa muli'mo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene, muli'mo gose gwa Ihema Isondo, yaani Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, gwamalaga. V'aizilaeli v'av'ezyaga gose ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'amuletelaga Mose Ihema Isondo haki'mo na vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose, visikizo vyalyo, felemu zyalyo, ngito zyalyo, nhi'ngi' zyalyo na vikali'lo vyalyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nfundi' ya ndi'li' zya ng'ondi i'zyo ziv'ililwe langi yazaa na nfundi' ya ndi'li' zya ndimu zingi' zya mu nyanza, muki'ngo gwa ku'ki'ga Hantu' Hasondo Muno, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa, miti' zyalyo na nfundi' ya wu'swanano, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "meza na vilwani'lo vyayo vyose, migate misondo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ki'nala cha ku'tu'u'li'la tala cha zahabu nsoso, tala zyacho ku' ku'hela, vilwani'lo vyacho vyose haki'mo na maguta ga ku'v'asi'zya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ihozezyo lya zahabu, maguta ga ku'v'ila, wu'bani wu'motu, muki'ngo gwa wingi'li'lo wa ihema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ihozezyo lya shaba haki'mo na wavu walyo wa shaba, miti' zyalyo na vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose, ikalaye na kikali'lo chalyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "miki'ngo zya lu'gu'tu', nhi'ngi' zyalo na vikali'lo vyazyo, muki'ngo gwa wingi'li'lo wa lu'gu'tu', ngoye na mmambo zyose, vilwani'lo vyose vya ku'tu'mi'lwa ku' Ihema Isondo, yaani Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vizwalo vyose i'vyo vifuumilwe visoga ku'nguno ya muli'mo gwa mugati' ha Hantu' Hasondo, vizwalo visondo vya muhozya Aloni, na vizwalo vya v'ana v'akwe ku'nguno muli'mo gwav'o gwa wu'hozya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'aizilaeli v'agelani'zyaga mili'mo zyose ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose walingu'laga ki'la ki'ntu', lingaga, wawonaga ku'v'a v'av'ezyaga visoga ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zya. Haho Mose wav'adosyaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
